    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Cursed Hour is a multiplayer game where four players explore a haunted mansion to find and destroy nine cursed relics, aiming to banish a vengeful ghost. Players locate the Altar Room, decipher clues, and use gadgets to find hidden relics. They solve riddles to place relics on the altar; correct placement destroys them, while mistakes trigger ghost hunts and reduce sanity. Collaborate, evade the ghost, and maintain sanity to successfully banish the haunting presence.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Cursed Hour is a multiplayer game where four players explore a haunted mansion to find and destroy nine cursed relics, aiming to banish a vengeful ghost. Players locate the Altar Room, decipher clues, and use gadgets to find hidden relics. They solve riddles to place relics on the altar; correct placement destroys them, while mistakes trigger ghost hunts and reduce sanity. Collaborate, evade the ghost, and maintain sanity to successfully banish the haunting presence.</p>",
    "short_description": "&quot;The Cursed Hour&quot; is a cooperative survival horror game where players explore a haunted mansion to find cursed relics and exorcise the supernatural. With every wrong move, the ghost gets more aggressive, forcing players to work together before fear and darkness consume them.",
